OL,3,GNEWSABoats stuck as silt builds up in
OL,4,Acity docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FNarrowboats and pleasure craft have
OL,7,Fbeen getting stuck in and around
OL,8,FGloucester Docks because of a build-up
OL,9,Fof silt.
OL,11,FThe silt levels are so high in places
OL,12,Fthat a bank has formed in the middle of
OL,13,Fthe basin. People who work and live
OL,14,Faround the docks have described it as
OL,15,Fthe worst they had ever seen.
OL,17,FStuart Mathewson said the silt had
OL,18,Fprevented him leaving in his narrowboat
OL,19,Fon Monday morning and the situation
OL,20,Fwould put him off returning to the city
OL,21,Fin future.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
