OL,3,GNEWSABoats stuck as silt builds up in
OL,4,Acity docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for The Canal and River
OL,7,FTrust said the charity had been in
OL,8,Ftouch with boaters about silt levels in
OL,9,Fthe docks. They added: "The second
OL,10,Fphase of our #4m dredging programme is
OL,11,Fdue to begin later this month."
